@startuml UKLabsMS_DomainModel
title UKLabsMS - Domain Model (no attributes)

hide empty members
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBorderColor #444441
skinparam ArrowColor #444441

' ---------- Staff ----------
abstract class Employee
class Receptionist
class MedicalLabTechnician
class ClinicalChemistryTechnologist
class SpecialistDoctor
class Administrator

Employee <|-- Receptionist
Employee <|-- MedicalLabTechnician
Employee <|-- ClinicalChemistryTechnologist
Employee <|-- SpecialistDoctor
Employee <|-- Administrator

' ---------- Core concepts ----------
class Client
class Test
class TestType
class Parameter
class Laboratory
class Sample
class TestResult
class Report
class Notification

' ---------- Domain associations ----------
Client "1" -- "0..*" Test : requests >
Test "0..*" -- "1" Laboratory : collected at >
Test "0..*" -- "1" TestType : is of >
Test "0..*" -- "1..*" Parameter : measures >
TestType "1..*" -- "1..*" Parameter : defines >
Laboratory "1..*" -- "0..*" TestType : offers >
Test "1" -- "1..*" Sample : has >
Test "1" -- "0..*" TestResult : produces >
TestResult "0..*" -- "1" Parameter : of >
Report "0..1" -- "1" Test : concludes >
Report "1" -- "1..*" Notification : triggers >
Notification "0..*" -- "1" Client : is sent to >

' ---------- Who does what ----------
Receptionist "1" -- "0..*" Client : registers >
Receptionist "1" -- "0..*" Test : registers >
MedicalLabTechnician "1" -- "0..*" Sample : collects >
ClinicalChemistryTechnologist "1" -- "0..*" TestResult : records >
SpecialistDoctor "1" -- "0..*" Report : writes >

Administrator ..> TestType : manages
Administrator ..> Parameter : manages
Administrator ..> Laboratory : manages
Administrator ..> Employee : manages

@enduml